    "body": "BIP375 requires 33-byte scan-key keydata for `PSBT_GLOBAL_SP_ECDH_SHARE`, `PSBT_GLOBAL_SP_DLEQ`, `PSBT_IN_SP_ECDH_SHARE`, and `PSBT_IN_SP_DLEQ`.\r\n\r\nThe reference structure validator currently checks the value lengths of these fields but ignores their keydata lengths. This change enforces the 33-byte keydata requirement for all four fields, with errors identifying the field and, for per-input fields, the input index.\r\n\r\nAdd unit tests covering missing, short, and oversized keydata, accepted 33-byte keydata, and the existing value-length checks. Document the unit test command in the validation reference README.\r\n\r\n",
